       tier-1 1500 us/period, 13312 KB; guard 80 us/period
[boot] webkit mode reserve 32768 KB (baseline 16384 KB). Tier-1 table unchanged.
[boot] cache colors: 32 (model: 2 MB 16-way cache, 4 KB pages);
       tier-1 pages in 7 own colors, padding 8192 KB
[boot] kernel image+bss 13871 KB of the 32768 KB system reserve
[boot] GICv2 from DTB: distributor 0x8000000, cpu interface 0x8010000
